	"name": "Bar Chart",
	"library": "daisyui",
	"category": "data-display",
	"description": "Mini bar chart in the daisyUI style — six svg bars on a baseline inside library card chrome; the highlighted month fills with the solid tone, the rest with its soft wash.",
